Upstream-Status: To upstream [upstream's wheels ship no licence file or licence metadata on any platform]

ci/publish.py hand-assembles every fbuild wheel, but writes only METADATA,
WHEEL and RECORD into the dist-info: the AGPL-3.0-only LICENSE from the
repository root never reaches the wheel, and METADATA carries no licence
field, although pyproject.toml declares `license = "AGPL-3.0-only"`.
Ship the LICENSE as `<dist-info>/licenses/LICENSE` and declare it with the
PEP 639 `License-Expression`/`License-File` fields (Metadata-Version 2.4),
reading the expression from `[project] license` in pyproject.toml.
